    <ReasonableCauseExplanation documentId="R000003" softwareId="23018249" softwareVersionNum="v1.00">
      <ExplanationTxt>To Whom It May Concern, The late filing was due to unforeseen administrative challenges during a period of organizational transition. Specifically, our organization experienced board changes and internal restructuring. Additionally, due to limited resources, we rely on volunteer or part-time support for all tasks including administrative responsibilities, and these factors contributed to the delay in completing and submitting our filing on time. As soon as we became aware of the missed deadline, we took immediate steps to rectify the issue, including reviewing our internal processes to prevent future delays. All For Logan remains committed to transparency and compliance with federal reporting requirements. We respectfully request that any penalties associated with the late filing be waived due to reasonable cause and not willful neglect. We greatly appreciate your consideration and understanding.</ExplanationTxt>
    </ReasonableCauseExplanation>
